{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_150_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_150_1063_p", "source_sha256": "eeff440fb39c08a35d69b9eb3e1d702285a30bf14d234ffba1482e0dadbb9c8a", "ja": "え？　だって、こんな状況だし……。", "zh": "诶？因为现在是这种情况啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
